fd refcount contention stage: complete
fd refcount contention: two cores retaining and releasing one object, count back to baseline ok
asid contention stage: complete
asid contention: two cores assigning, every number advanced the counter once ok
page contention stage: complete
page contention: two cores allocating and freeing, every page back, none freed twice ok
freelist contention stage: unlocked
freelist contention stage: locked
freelist contention: unlocked hands one index to both cores, a caller's lock stops it ok
pool contention stage: complete
pool contention: two cores cycling one pool, every allocation given back, no handle refused ok
